<title>USA: Styling Technology chair has 23 pct stake.</title>
<headline>Styling Technology chair has 23 pct stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sam Leopold, chairman and chief executive officer of Styling Technology Corp, said Thursday he holds a 23 percent stake in the company or 857,851 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Leopold said his latest transaction includes the purchase of 50,000 additional common shares on Nov 26 at $10 per share following the company's initial public offering.</p>
<p>The perfumes and cosmetics firm is based in Phoenix, Arizona.</p>
